- Pokket is vendored unmodified as the submodule extern/pokket. Its
  emulation core, core/ (the only part this repository builds), is under the
  MIT License, copyright Darien Liu (mentalfoundry); see
  extern/pokket/core/LICENSE. Pokket's frontends, tools and its
  pk_timing_bench app are GPL-3.0 (extern/pokket/LICENSE). None of them is
  built into the package; the tests read pk_timing_bench.mcs, unchanged,
  from the submodule as a memory card.

- BUILT ARTIFACTS (core.wbx and the pokket.chimeraCore package) contain this
  repository's code and Pokket's core/, both MIT, and nothing else. The
  package carries both licence texts.

- No BIOS, firmware or game is part of this repository or of the package.
  The PocketStation BIOS is Sony's, and the user brings it.

